CustomerCode:${userCustomer.customerCode}
Ref:${dunningLetterRefNo}
<#assign aDateTime = .now> <#assign aDate = aDateTime?date>
Date:${aDate?string("dd-MMM-yyyy")}
${'\n'}
The CFO/Finance/Accounts
${userCustomer.customerName}
Dear Customer,
Subject: 3rd and Final Reminder - Overdue Invoice(s)
<#setting date_format="dd-MMM-yyyy"> <#assign bDateTime = firstMailSentDate> <#assign bDate = bDateTime?date("yyyy-MM-dd")> <#assign cDateTime = secondMailSentDate> <#assign cDate = cDateTime?date("yyyy-MM-dd")>
Ref : Our Letter 1 Ref ${dunningLetterOneRefNo} Dated : ${bDate?date}
Ref : Our Letter 2 Ref ${dunningLetterTwoRefNo} Dated : ${cDate?date}
We regret to inform you that payment for invoice(s) mentioned in attached annexure 1 are still not paid and as per our Credit Policy, we have been forced to instruct our office to suspend all deliveries of spare parts and services.
Should this reminder not being kept into consideration, ${userClient} will be forced to initiate appropriate legal action against you at your cost for recovery of due amount along with interest.
Sale Order No | Invoice No | Invoice Date | Invoice Value | Outstanding Amount | PO | Desc
<#list listOfInvoices as invoiceList>
${(invoiceList.saleOrderNo)!} | ${invoiceList.invoiceNo} | ${invoiceList.invoiceDate} | ${(invoiceList.invoiceValue)!} | ${invoiceList.totalOutstanding} | ${invoiceList.poNumber} | ${(invoiceList.desc)!}
</#list>
Please feel free to reach the following person, if you wish to discuss any issues.
${dunningLetterContactInfo!}
To view your invoices and provide feedback please click on the below link.
Click Here (https://${subdomain}.inebura.ai/intg/customer-link/${token})
Yours truly.
${userClient}
